    description: "Repro: `main = (identity helper) other` -> only edge main -> other.\n\nFound by the 2026-10-10 docstring-staleness audit (reviewer + default-REJECT verifier, reproduced). Notebook: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10102026.md."  # d5f3
